{"id":"n88438-1-11","stage":3,"title":"휴양지 · 休养地","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n88438-1-11-1","ko":"휴양지로 좋은 곳 추천 좀 해 주세요.","zh":"请推荐一些适合度假的好地方吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"휴양지로","meaning":"休养地，疗养地","explanation":"휴양지：休养地，疗养地；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"휴양지","audio":"/audio/d785e7886022f35ade7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88438","senseId":"1","lemma":"휴양지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋은","meaning":"行，可以","explanation":"좋다：行，可以；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"12","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"곳","meaning":"地方，地区","explanation":"곳：地方，地区","readings":[{"term":"곳","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18661","senseId":"1","lemma":"곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"추천","meaning":"推荐，举荐","explanation":"추천：推荐，举荐","readings":[{"term":"추천","audio":"/audio/5891b70a9b6fdf41d3b6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27796","senseId":"1","lemma":"추천","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해","meaning":"做（추천을 하다：推荐）","explanation":"하다：做（추천을 하다：推荐）；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주세요.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d785e7886022f35a","term":"휴양지","zh":"休养地，疗养地","audio":"/audio/d785e7886022f35ade7c.mp3","entryId":"88438","definition":"适合安静休息、照顾健康的地方。","pronunciation":["휴양지"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"行，可以","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某个行动或事情等不成问题。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"24875f860934407b","term":"곳","zh":"地方，地区","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3","entryId":"18661","definition":"一个特定的地点或位置。","pronunciation":["곧"]},{"id":"5891b70a9b6fdf41","term":"추천","zh":"推荐，举荐","audio":"/audio/5891b70a9b6fdf41d3b6.mp3","entryId":"27796","definition":"负责介绍符合某些条件的人或物品。","pronunciation":["추천"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做（추천을 하다：推荐）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"做（추천을 하다：推荐）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4c8a9301a5f2fbc438be.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n88438-1-11-2","ko":"단풍도 들고 했으니 설악산은 어때요?","zh":"既然现在正是红叶季，雪岳山怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"단풍도","meaning":"红叶，枫叶","explanation":"단풍：红叶，枫叶；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"단풍","audio":"/audio/d3e79a469b1eb10515e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28378","senseId":"1","lemma":"단풍","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들고","meaning":"进到，进入","explanation":"들다：进到，进入；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71686","senseId":"17","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"했으니","meaning":"把前面的情况作为理由（单举红叶变色这一情况）","explanation":"하다：把前面的情况作为理由（单举红叶变色这一情况）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；으니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62899","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"설악산은","meaning":"雪岳山","explanation":"설악산：雪岳山；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"설악산은","audio":"/audio/7491f21d323f28c1173e.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"어때요?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d3e79a469b1eb105","term":"단풍","zh":"红叶，枫叶","audio":"/audio/d3e79a469b1eb10515e0.mp3","entryId":"28378","definition":"在秋季树叶变成黄色或红色的现象；或指变成那样的叶子。","pronunciation":["단풍"]},{"id":"7ff37822e89462ea","term":"들다","zh":"进到，进入","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3","entryId":"71686","definition":"到了某个时间或季节。","pronunciation":["들다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"把前面的情况作为理由（单举红叶变色这一情况）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62899","definition":"把前面的情况作为理由（单举红叶变色这一情况）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/0c228072dca5f1565852.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.9,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=88438","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":104,"sequenceScore":2.7267,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["请推荐一些适合度假的好地方吧。","既然现在正是红叶季，雪岳山怎么样？","还得再走那么远吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["请推荐一些适合度假的好地方吧。","既然现在正是红叶季，雪岳山怎么样？","还得再走那么远吗？"],"answer":1}]}
